{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-18871-r4531777","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Bean Jahni Soup","sourcePageId":18871,"sourceRevision":"4531777","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-08-21T00:52:07Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Bean%20Jahni%20Soup&oldid=4531777","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:42.134Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Albanian recipes","Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using mint","Category:Recipes using white bean","Category:Vegan recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"cb74a2f83a77ab21ce4c8825a982ba9cdd901d0fb528abef9dcd1d684697300d","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{recipesummary|category=Soup recipes|servings=4|time=3 &frac12; hours|difficulty=3}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Soups|Soups]] | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Albania|Cuisine of Albania]]\n\n'''Bean Jahni soup''', '''''Jani me fasule''''', is an [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Albania|Albania]]n dish of bean soup.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] of dry white [[Cookbook:Beans|beans]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]s\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Tomato Sauce|tomato sauce]]\n* 1 tablespoon chopped [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* 1 tablespoon chopped [[cookbook:mint|mint]]\n* [[cookbook:salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Chiles|Chile]] powder\n\n==Preparation==\n# [[cookbook:Boil|Boil]] beans in hot water in an uncovered pot for 5 minutes. Rinse and boil for another 15 minutes in a covered [[cookbook:Stock Pot|stock pot]] in 3 cups hot water. \n# [[cookbook:Sauté|Sauté]] onion in olive oil until it turns yellow. Add 2 tablespoons bean stock from the pot along with tomato sauce, parsley, salt and chili powder for taste. Cook for 10 minutes or until a thick sauce is formed, then pour everything into the pot. \n# Add chopped mint, cover tightly and cook for 2 hours over low heat, or for 30 minutes in a [[cookbook:pressure cooker|pressure cooker]]. This should produce a thick juice, covering beans by &frac12; [[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (1.5 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]]). Serve hot.\n\n==References==\n''This article contains information from [http://www.frosina.org Frosina.org] and it is used with [[w:User:Dori/www.frosina.org permission|permission]].''  \n\n[[Category:Recipes using white bean]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup|Bean Jahni soup|]]\n[[Category:Albanian recipes|Bean Jahni soup]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[category:Gluten-free recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes|Bean Jahni soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mint]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Bean Jahni Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 cups of dry white beans","sourceText":"2 cups of dry white beans","amountText":"2 cups of dry white beans","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup chopped onions","sourceText":"½ cup chopped onions","amountText":"½ cup chopped onions","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBindi